{"content":"It seems there is a persistent issue with the interface. Let's manually perform the calculation and provide the result.\n\nThe formula for percentage change is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage Change} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{New Value} - \\text{Old Value}}{\\text{Old Value}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nHere, the new value is the free cash flow for 2010, which is $1415 million, and the old value is the free cash flow for 2009, which is $699 million.\n\nLet's calculate it step-by-step:\n1. Calculate the difference between the new value and the old value:\n\\[ 1415 - 699 = 716 \\]\n\n2. Divide the difference by the old value:\n\\[ \\frac{716}{699} \\approx 1.024 \\]\n\n3. Multiply by 100 to get the percentage:\n\\[ 1.024 \\times 100 = 102.4\\% \\]\n\nSo, the percentage change in free cash flow from 2009 to 2010 is approximately 102.4%.\n\nThe final answer is:\n```json\n{\n  \"final\": \"102.4%\"\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":8.745694787008688,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":284,"generated_token_ids":[2132,4977,1052,374,264,24999,4265,448,279,3749,13,6771,594,20083,2736,279,21937,323,3410,279,1102,382,785,14806,369,11414,2297,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,10388,92,284,1124,2359,7,1124,37018,35702,1318,90,3564,5162,92,481,1124,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,35702,1318,90,18284,5162,3417,1124,1291,8,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,1124,2533,8420,11,279,501,897,374,279,1910,8350,6396,369,220,17,15,16,15,11,892,374,400,16,19,16,20,3526,11,323,279,2310,897,374,279,1910,8350,6396,369,220,17,15,15,24,11,892,374,400,21,24,24,3526,382,10061,594,11047,432,3019,14319,29208,510,16,13,20517,279,6672,1948,279,501,897,323,279,2310,897,510,78045,220,16,19,16,20,481,220,21,24,24,284,220,22,16,21,1124,2533,17,13,62902,279,6672,553,279,2310,897,510,78045,1124,37018,90,22,16,21,15170,21,24,24,92,1124,48053,220,16,13,15,17,19,1124,2533,18,13,71059,553,220,16,15,15,311,633,279,11414,510,78045,220,16,13,15,17,19,1124,15136,220,16,15,15,284,220,16,15,17,13,19,59,4,1124,2533,4416,11,279,1141